#, no-wrap
msgid "True/False {#truefalse}"
msgstr "Benar/Salah {#truefalse}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F The Quantum Fourier Transform is the quantum analog of the classical discrete Fourier transform (DFT).\n"
msgstr "B/S Jelmaan Fourier Kuantum adalah analog kuantum bagi jelmaan Fourier diskret klasik (DFT).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F QFT can be implemented using only Hadamard and CNOT gates.\n"
msgstr "B/S QFT boleh dilaksanakan menggunakan hanya get Hadamard dan CNOT.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F QFT is a key component of Shor’s algorithm.\n"
msgstr "B/S QFT adalah komponen utama algoritma Shor.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F The output of Quantum Phase Estimation is a quantum state representing the eigenvector of the operator.\n"
msgstr "B/S Keluaran Anggaran Fasa Kuantum adalah keadaan kuantum yang mewakili vektor eigen bagi pengoperasi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F QPE requires the use of the inverse Quantum Fourier Transform (QFT$^\\dag$).\n"
msgstr "B/S QPE memerlukan penggunaan songsang Jelmaan Fourier Kuantum (QFT$^\\dag$).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "T/F In QPE, if the phase $\\phi$ is exactly representable with $n$ bits, the algorithm gives the correct result with probability 1.\n"
msgstr "B/S Dalam QPE, jika fasa $\\phi$ boleh diwakili dengan tepat menggunakan $n$ bit, algoritma memberikan keputusan yang betul dengan kebarangkalian 1.\n"

